	(text "NOTES\n\n1.  This schematic establishes the wiring and pin numbering for any project\n    that cites this schematic. \n2.  This schematic is based on the Espressif ESP32 DevKitC packaged by Digikey\n    on 2020-May-12 and featuring the ESP32-WROOM-32D microcontroller unit (MCU).\n3.  Both the pin numbers and the pin functions on this schematic may differ\n    from numbers and functions used by other board manufacturers.\n4.  NeoPixel device Din lead is indicated by a drop of nailpolish on the base\n    of the plastic lens.  See the graphic image in Zone 5C."
